 AI-driven decision-making in these…"],"features":["Multi-Agent Coordination","Structured research planning","Dynamic priority adjustment","Source deduplication","Advanced Tavily search integration"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/multi-agent_deep-research/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"665979790f89783bb7c01409a3974a7b42f43e8504e19260c70c89a524acb52f","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:20:29.264Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T09:11:48.021Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A sophisticated multi-agent system for conducting in-depth technical research using AI. This system orchestrates multiple specialized agents to perform comprehensive research, analyze information, and generate detailed technical reports.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/multi-agent_deep-research/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Community Engagement: Engaging with communities affected by AI systems can help to ensure that their needs and concerns are taken into account.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/multi-agent_deep-research/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"665979790f89783bb7c01409a3974a7b42f43e8504e19260c70c89a524acb52f","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/multi-agent_deep-research/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T09:11:48.021Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-07-16T13:25:53.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Agents-MCP-Hackathon/multi-agent_deep-research/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T09:11:48.021Z","hash":"665979790f89783bb7c01409a3974a7b42f43e8504e19260c70c89a524acb52f","originalBytes":60615,"storedBytes":60615,"truncated":false},"subjects":["MCP servers & agents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":["MCP servers & ag